als his grand plan: a heist of Sinfrontera National Bank, where the Columbian cartel La Polilla Negra clean their dirty money. Jason and Lucia case the bank and meet Raul and Andrea, who task them with finding Nicole Park, a security expert for the bank.', 'BAN_SETUP_DESC': \"Gather information on the Sinfrontera National Bank's security measures.\"}, 'BIL_BOSS': {'BIL_BOSS': 'Taking Liberties', 'PROG_BIL_BOSS_DESC_REPLAY': 'Jason and Lucia meet with Giorgio in his spa, where he explains he will get them a full Presidential pardon in exchange for their help. Their conversation is interrupted by a hitman, sent by the Albanian mob to kill Giorgio. The hitman agrees to give Giorgio one last chance, but demands Giorgio intercepts and destroys a coke shipment being sent from Latin America to Europe that would disrupt their business.', 'BIL_BOSS_DESC': \"Giorgio's double dealings has landed him in more hot water.\"}, 'BIL_CONFR': {'BIL_CONFR': 'Starting From Zero', 'PROG_BIL_CONFR_DESC_REPLAY': \"With the whole city's police force on their tail and their bank accounts frozen, Jason and Lucia discuss if they should stay together or split up for good once they are out of this mess. They retrieve the hard drive from Andrea and the statue from the storage lockup, but an unexpected message from Mattia leads to an encounter with his boss, shipping magnate Giorgio Gallo - the man who the bag belonged to all along.\", 'BIL_CONFR_DESC': 'Raul is dead, and the whole city is after you. Keep a low profile and get back your valuables.'}, 'BIL_FINALE_M': {'BIL_FINALE_M': 'The End of the Road'}, 'BIL_FINAL_B': {'BIL_FINAL_B': 'The End of the Road'}, 'BIL_FUN': {'BIL_FUN': 'Day Release', 'PROG_BIL_FUN_DESC_REPLAY': \"Mattia meets Jason and Lucia at the Rusty Anchor and one of his men removes Lucia's ankle tag. They head out to hook up with Kat and a bunch of Mattia's friends on a yacht in Vice City before moving onto Club NINE1NINE. The morning after, Mattia offers them a well-paid job collecting a bag from a locker in the Grassrivers Visitor Centre, but Jason is skeptical.\", 'BIL_FUN_DESC': 'Mattia and Kat know how to have a good time, and Lucia is ready to blow off some steam.'}, 'BIL_HOUSE': {'BIL_HOUSE': 'Home Sweet Home', 'PROG_BIL_HOUSE_DESC_REPLAY': 'With Jason on his way to hospital, Lucia returns home to grab his stash, but is attacked by masked men searching for the bag from the locker. She escapes but their house is burnt down.', 'BIL_HOUSE_DESC': \"Collect some of Jason's belongings before the two of you skip town.\"}, 'BIL_LAW': {'BIL_LAW': 'Honest Abe', 'PROG_BIL_LAW_DESC_REPLAY': 'With the cops off their back, Jason and Lucia visit their lawyer, Abe Gonzalez, to work out a deal that can end their legal problems.', 'BIL_LAW_DESC': 'Visit Abe Gonzalez to talk about a possible deal.'}, 'BIL_MOTEL': {'BIL_MOTEL': 'Checking Out', 'PROG_BIL_MOTEL_DESC_REPLAY': \"Running out of options around Port Gellhorn, Jason and Lucia decide they're almost ready to move to Vice City. While they pack up at the Starlet Motel, the masked men from the hospital arrive in search of them and the bag. Jason and Lucia escape to the city.\", 'BIL_MOTEL_DESC': 'Escape the motel as quickly as possible and head to Vice City.'}, 'BIL_MOTEL_NON_VIOLENT': {'BIL_MOTEL_NON_VIOLENT': 'Checking Out'}, 'BIL_MOTEL_VIOLENT': {'BIL_MOTEL_VIOLENT': 'Checking Out'}, 'BIL_PENT': {'BIL_PENT': 'The End of the Road', 'PROG_BIL_PENT_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Lucia stage a final assault on Giorgio's penthouse to recover the hard drive and start their new lives.\"}, 'BIL_PENT_B_BRIAN': {'BIL_PENT_B_BRIAN': 'The End of the Road'}, 'BIL_PENT_M_MENDEZ': {'BIL_PENT_M_MENDEZ': 'The End of the Road'}, 'BIL_PICK': {'BIL_PICK': 'Tourist Trap', 'PROG_BIL_PICK_DESC_REPLAY': 'Mattia says the pick-up job is on. Jason and Lucia, disguised as Mattia and Kat, take the bag out of a locker at the Grassriver Visitor Center, but are quickly arrested. Everyone is then attacked by dirty cops and Jason is badly wounded. They manage to get out with the bag and Cal takes Jason to hospital.', 'BIL_PICK_DESC': \"Follow Mattia's instructions and make the pick-up from Grassrivers Visitor Center.\"}, 'BIL_PICK_DAY_TIME_START': {'BIL_PICK_DAY_TIME_START': 'Tourist Trap'}, 'BIL_PICK_NIGHT_TIME_START': {'BIL_PICK_NIGHT_TIME_START': 'Tourist Trap'}, 'BIL_PRECI': {'BIL_PRECI': 'Protective Custody', 'PROG_BIL_PRECI_DESC_REPLAY': \"After meeting with Abe, Giorgio reveals he has betrayed Jason and Lucia. They are separately taken into custody, and Lucia is told by the statewide prosecutor, Danica Howard, that unless they can get the hard drive from Giorgio, they'll never be free. Jason and Lucia separately fend off attempts on their lives by dirty cops, leading to a final confrontation with Méndez himself.\", 'BIL_PRECI_DESC': 'You laid out all your past crimes for Abe, and he has everything he needs.'}, 'BIL_PREG': {'BIL_PREG': 'VC Baby', 'PROG_BIL_PREG_DESC_REPLAY': \"When Kat goes into labor in Giorgio's penthouse, Mattia asks Jason and Lucia for help.\", 'BIL_PREG_DESC': 'Kat is in labor and Mattia will miss it unless you help.'}, 'BIL_RED': {'BIL_RED': 'Caught Slipping', 'PROG_BIL_RED_DESC_REPLAY': \"Returning to their apartment, Jason and Lucia stumble across a burglary. They chase down the thieves and discover they were just stealing the former tenant's underwear. The hard drive is safe. They decide to put the bag from the Visitor Center in a storage facility for safety.\", 'BIL_RED_DESC': 'The apartment has been broken into. Catch the robbers before they escape.'}, 'BIL_WHEEL': {'BIL_WHEEL': 'Discharge Time', 'PROG_BIL_WHEEL_DESC_REPLAY': 'Lucia rushes to see Jason in Vice City Hospital, but the dirty cops and masked men are there and want them dead. They fight their way out of the building and flee west to Kelly County.', 'BIL_WHEEL_DESC': 'Get Jason to safety before whoever torched the house tracks him down.'}, 'CLB_DEAL': {'CLB_DEAL': \"Dealer's Choice\", 'PROG_CLB_DEAL_DESC_REPLAY': \"Boobie says Jason owes him a favor for letting him and Lucia stay in his apartment, so sends him on a drug deal. Dre'Quan comes as backup while Jason picks up some coke from local dealer, Tyrone, then sells it in Crosstown. Back at the apartment, Cal arrives and tries to break into the hardrive but fails. He tells Jason and Lucia that Brian used to have a highly capable VC contact who may be able to help them.\", 'CLB_DEAL_DESC': 'Boobie gave you a place to stay, but you owe him something in return.'}, 'CLB_EVI': {'CLB_EVI': 'Fresh Evidence', 'PROG_CLB_EVI_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Dre'Quan inflitrate Dante Fresh's mansion and steal the blackmail material he has on Royce Jones. They meet with Royce's assistant, Briana, who says the Dimez will headline VYB's reopening launch party soon.\", 'CLB_EVI_DESC': \"Break into Dante's mansion and steal his private tapes.\"}, 'CLB_HELI': {'CLB_HELI': 'Photo/Shoot', 'PROG_CLB_HELI_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Lucia help Dre'Quan do a photo shoot for the Dimez with a helicopter at the top of a skyscraper. Dre'Quan heads down to the lobby to meet a club promoter called KD, where he is ambushed and kidnapped by Cash City. Jason, Lucia, and the Dimez rescue him. KD promises Dre'Quan a meet with club promoter Royce Jones to make up for it.\", 'CLB_HELI_DESC': \"Help Dre'Quan shoot some promo material for the Dimez.\"}, 'CLB_MEET': {'CLB_MEET': 'Welcome to Vice City', 'PROG_CLB_MEET_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Lucia meet Jason's friend, Dre'Quan, at Jack of Hearts - the strip club where he runs a record label in Crosstown, Vice City. Dre'Quan introduces them to his boss, Boobie Ike. Boobie says they're welcome to stay in his apartment nearby. They settle into their new home.\", 'CLB_MEET_DESC': \"Dre'Quan is at the Jack of Hearts. He should have a place nearby where you can lay low.\"}, 'CLB_PARTY': {'CLB_PARTY': 'Headliners', 'PROG_CLB_PARTY_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Luci"}
{"step_index":1600,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T23:18:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nShowing lines 1-300 of 1089\n1: import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n2: import matplotlib.patches as patches\n3: import os\n4: import shutil\n5: \n6: # Directories\n7: WORKSPACE_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\"\n8: DOWNLOADS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\"\n9: ANTIGRAV_DL_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\antigravity_version\"\n10: ANTIGRAV_WS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\output\\antigravity_version\"\n11: WORKFLOW_CHARTS_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\gta 6 mission workflow charts\"\n12: ARTIFACT_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\.gemini\\antigravity-cli\\brain\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\"\n13: \n14: # Classic Ground-Truth Theme Colors (Matching image_1188e9.jpg & GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.jpg)\n15: BG_COLOR = \"#33363b\"          # Slate-gray background\n16: CARD_BG_NORMAL = \"#fef08a\"    # Warm cream / yellow\n17: CARD_BORDER_NORMAL = \"#ca8a04\"# Golden yellow border\n18: CARD_BG_CLIMAX = \"#ffedd5\"    # Warm peach / orange\n19: CARD_BORDER_CLIMAX = \"#ea580c\"# Deep orange border\n20: CARD_BG_SKIP = \"#f3e8ff\"      # Light purple for skippable side missions\n21: CARD_BORDER_SKIP = \"#a855f7\"  # Purple border\n22: TEXT_COLOR = \"#1c1917\"        # Dark charcoal / black text\n23: SUBTEXT_COLOR = \"#44403c\"     # Muted charcoal subtext\n24: \n25: def draw_mission(ax, x, y, w, h, title, subtitle=\"\", is_climax=False, is_gate=False, is_skip=False, font_size=8.2):\n26:     if is_climax:\n27:         bg = CARD_BG_CLIMAX\n28:         border = CARD_BORDER_CLIMAX\n29:     elif is_skip:\n30:         bg = CARD_BG_SKIP\n31:         border = CARD_BORDER_SKIP\n32:     else:\n33:         bg = CARD_BG_NORMAL\n34:         border = CARD_BORDER_NORMAL\n35:         \n36:     lw = 2.0 if (is_climax or is_gate) else 1.2\n37:     \n38:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n39:         (x, y), w, h,\n40:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.10\",\n41:         linewidth=lw,\n42:         edgecolor=border,\n43:         facecolor=bg,\n44:         zorder=3\n45:     )\n46:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n47:     \n48:     ty = y + h/2 + 0.14 if subtitle else y + h/2\n49:     c_title = \"#581c87\" if is_skip else TEXT_COLOR\n50:     c_sub = \"#6b21a8\" if is_skip else SUBTEXT_COLOR\n51:     \n52:     ax.text(x + w/2, ty, title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=c_title, zorder=4)\n53:     if subtitle:\n54:         ax.text(x + w/2, y + 0.22, subtitle, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size-1.8, color=c_sub, zorder=4)\n55: \n56: def draw_callout(ax, x, y, w, h, text, icon_type=\"text\", font_size=7.0):\n57:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n58:         (x, y), w, h,\n59:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n60:         linewidth=1.0,\n61:         edgecolor=\"#71717a\",\n62:         facecolor=\"#ffffff\",\n63:         zorder=3\n64:     )\n65:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n66:     \n67:     prefix = \"\"\n68:     if icon_type == \"phone\":\n69:         prefix = \"[CALL] \"\n70:     elif icon_type == \"text\":\n71:         prefix = \"[MSG] \"\n72:     elif icon_type == \"mailbox\":\n73:         prefix = \"[MAILBOX] \"\n74:     elif icon_type == \"cash\":\n75:         prefix = \"[$] \"\n76:         \n77:     ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, prefix + text, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\" if icon_type in [\"phone\", \"cash\"] else \"normal\", color=\"#09090b\", zorder=4)\n78: \n79: def draw_heart(ax, x, y, w, h, text, skip_label=\"[ANY% SKIP]\", font_size=7.0):\n80:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n81:         (x, y), w, h,\n82:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n83:         linewidth=1.2,\n84:         edgecolor=\"#f43f5e\",\n85:         facecolor=\"#ffe4e6\",\n86:         zorder=3\n87:     )\n88:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n89:     t = \"♥ \" + text\n90:     if skip_label:\n91:         t += \"\\n\" + skip_label\n92:     ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, t, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#9f1239\", zorder=4)\n93: \n94: def draw_side(ax, x, y, w, h, text, font_size=7.0):\n95:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n96:         (x, y), w, h,\n97:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n98:         linewidth=1.2,\n99:         edgecolor=\"#a855f7\",\n100:         facecolor=\"#f3e8ff\",\n101:         zorder=3\n102:     )\n103:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n104:     t = text + \"\\n[OPTIONAL / SKIP]\"\n105:     ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, t, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, color=\"#581c87\", zorder=4)\n106: \n107: def draw_diamond(ax, cx, cy, rx, ry, text, font_size=6.8):\n108:     pts = [[cx, cy + ry], [cx + rx, cy], [cx, cy - ry], [cx - rx, cy]]\n109:     poly = patches.Polygon(pts, closed=True, linewidth=1.4, edgecolor=\"#cbd5e1\", facecolor=\"#ffffff\", zorder=3)\n110:     ax.add_patch(poly)\n111:     ax.text(cx, cy, text, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#0f172a\", zorder=4)\n112: \n113: def draw_speedrun_badge(ax, x, y, w, h, title, note, font_size=6.8):\n114:     rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n115:         (x, y), w, h,\n116:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n117:         linewidth=1.4,\n118:         edgecolor=\"#10b981\",\n119:         facecolor=\"#064e3b\",\n120:         zorder=3\n121:     )\n122:     ax.add_patch(rect)\n123:     ax.text(x + w/2, y + h - 0.24, \"⚡ \" + title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size+0.6, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#34d399\", zorder=4)\n124:     ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2 - 0.12, note, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, color=\"#ecfdf5\", zorder=4)\n125: \n126: def draw_arrow(ax, p1, p2, color=\"#ffffff\", lw=1.2, rad=0.0):\n127:     conn = f\"arc3,rad={rad}\" if rad != 0 else \"arc3,rad=0\"\n128:     ax.annotate(\n129:         \"\",\n130:         xy=p2, xytext=p1,\n131:         arrowprops=dict(\n132:             arrowstyle=\"->,head_width=0.28,head_length=0.38\",\n133:             color=color,\n134:             lw=lw,\n135:             shrinkA=3,\n136:             shrinkB=3,\n137:             connectionstyle=conn\n138:         ),\n139:         zorder=2\n140:     )\n141: \n142: def draw_stage_bridge(ax, x1, y1, x2, y2, gx, label):\n143:     ax.plot([x1, gx, gx, x2], [y1, y1, y2, y2], color=\"#ffffff\", lw=1.6, zorder=2)\n144:     draw_arrow(ax, (gx, y2), (x2, y2), color=\"#ffffff\", lw=1.6)\n145:     \n146:     badge = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n147:         (gx - 0.9, (y1 + y2)/2 - 0.35), 1.8, 0.7,\n148:         boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.02,rounding_size=0.08\",\n149:         linewidth=1.0,\n150:         edgecolor=\"#cbd5e1\",\n151:         facecolor=\"#26292e\",\n152:         zorder=4\n153:     )\n154:     ax.add_patch(badge)\n155:     ax.text(gx, (y1 + y2)/2, label, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=6.5, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#fde047\", zorder=5)\n156: \n157: def copy_to_all(filename):\n158:     src = os.path.join(ARTIFACT_DIR, filename)\n159:     targets = [\n160:         os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, filename),\n161:         os.path.join(DOWNLOADS_DIR, filename),\n162:         os.path.join(ANTIGRAV_DL_DIR, filename),\n163:         os.path.join(ANTIGRAV_WS_DIR, filename),\n164:         os.path.join(WORKFLOW_CHARTS_DIR, filename),\n165:     ]\n166:     for dst in targets:\n167:         os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(dst), exist_ok=True)\n168:         copied = False\n169:         for attempt in range(3):\n170:             try:\n171:                 shutil.copyfile(src, dst)\n172:                 copied = True\n173:                 break\n174:             except Exception as e:\n175:                 import time\n176:                 time.sleep(0.3)\n177:         if not copied:\n178:             try:\n179:                 with open(src, \"rb\") as fsrc:\n180:                     data = fsrc.read()\n181:                 tmp_dst = dst + \".new\"\n182:                 with open(tmp_dst, \"wb\") as ftmp:\n183:                     ftmp.write(data)\n184:                 os.replace(tmp_dst, dst)\n185:                 copied = True\n186:             except Exception as ex:\n187:                 print(f\"Warning: Could not copy {filename} to {dst}: {ex}\")\n188:     print(f\"Propagated {filename} to all locations.\")\n189: \n190: def setup_header(ax, title, subtitle, max_x, y_top):\n191:     ax.text(max_x / 2, y_top, title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=16, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#ffffff\")\n192:     ax.text(max_x / 2, y_top - 0.5, subtitle, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=9.2, color=\"#fde047\")\n193: \n194: # =========================================================================\n195: # 1. CHAPTER 1: EXACT MATCH TO BUILD 1.0.2.1 GROUND TRUTH (MISSIONS 1 - 21)\n196: # =========================================================================\n197: def render_chapter_1():\n198:     fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(26, 36), dpi=200)\n199:     fig.patch.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n200:     ax.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n201:     ax.set_xlim(0, 26)\n202:     ax.set_ylim(0, 36)\n203:     ax.axis(\"off\")\n204:     \n205:     setup_header(\n206:         ax,\n207:         \"GRAND THEFT AUTO VI — CHAPTER 1: LEONIDA KEYS MISSION FLOW\",\n208:         \"Ground Truth Directed Acyclic Graph (Build 1.0.2.1) | Missions 1 - 21 | All 7 Verified Any% Auto-Flag Skips\",\n209:         26,\n210:         y_top=35.2\n211:     )\n212:     \n213:     mw, mh = 4.2, 1.05\n214:     center_x = 11.2\n215:     \n216:     # 1. PROLOGUE\n217:     draw_mission(ax, center_x, 33.4, mw, mh, \"1. PROLOGUE [INT_PROLO]\", \"Lucia Prison Counselor Interview | Protagonist: Lucia\")\