ct Federal Deal\\nFight through Coast Guard to Airstrip.\\n★ AWARDS $2,000,000 Payout (Not required!) ★\", is_climax=True, font_size=8.0)\n901:     draw_arrow(ax, (cx + w/2 - 2.8, dia_y), (0.8 + end_w/2, end_y + 1.55), color=\"#ffffff\", rad=-0.2)\n902:     \n903:     # Ending B (Center - Speedrun Route)\n904:     draw_speedrun_badge(ax, 7.4, end_y, end_w, 1.55, \"ENDING B: THE DEAL (ANY% ROUTE)\", \"Accept Mendez Deal & Enter Immunity\\nSkips Multi-Stage Offshore Boat Chase!\\n★ SAVES 8-12 MINUTES IN ANY% SPEEDRUN ★\", font_size=7.5)\n905:     draw_arrow(ax, (cx + w/2, dia_y - 0.95), (7.4 + end_w/2, end_y + 1.55), color=\"#10b981\", lw=2.2)\n906:     \n907:     # Ending C (Right)\n908:     draw_side(ax, 14.0, end_y, end_w, 1.55, \"ENDING C: THE SACRIFICE\\nOne Partner Escapes, One Stays Behind\\nSolo Evacuation Flight to South America\\nUnique Melancholy Radio Broadcasts\", font_size=7.5)\n909:     draw_arrow(ax, (cx + w/2 + 2.8, dia_y), (14.0 + end_w/2, end_y + 1.55), color=\"#ffffff\", rad=0.2)\n910:     \n911:     # Final Epilogue & Credits\n912:     epi_y = end_y - 2.2\n913:     draw_mission(ax, 5.8, epi_y, 8.4, 1.35, \"101. Final Evacuation  →  102. Epilogue & Credits\", \"Story Campaign Concluded | Free Roam Restored\\nFull Leonida Map Unlocked for Post-Game Activities\", is_climax=True, font_size=9.2)\n914:     \n915:     draw_arrow(ax, (0.8 + end_w/2, end_y), (5.8 + 1.2, epi_y + 1.35))\n916:     draw_arrow(ax, (7.4 + end_w/2, end_y), (5.8 + 4.2, epi_y + 1.35), color=\"#10b981\")\n917:     draw_arrow(ax, (14.0 + end_w/2, end_y), (5.8 + 7.2, epi_y + 1.35))\n918:     \n919:     out_file = os.path.join(ARTIFACT_DIR, \"flowchart_chapter_5.png\")\n920:     plt.savefig(out_file, bbox_inches=\"tight\", facecolor=BG_COLOR)\n921:     plt.close()\n922:     copy_to_all(\"flowchart_chapter_5.png\")\n923:     print(\"Rendered Chapter 5 (Classic Design).\")\n924: \n925: # =========================================================================\n926: # 6. COMBINED FLOWCHA